id: pm-gh1461
title: "GH-1461: Normalize supported inline flag placeholders across help and parsing"
description: "Preserve the explicitly supported legacy inline-placeholder flag syntax while making placeholder arity and canonical option identity consistent across registration, help, contracts and real invocation."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:extensions","area:sdk",command-contracts,github-intake
